<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT EASTERN PROVINCE XI IN ONE-DAY MATCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT EASTERN PROVINCE XI IN ONE-DAY MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>ZWIDE, South Africa 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat an Eastern Province Invitation XI by 15 runs in a 45-over match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Australia: 243-4 in 45 overs, Eastern Province XI 228-8 in 45 overs.</p>
</text>
